                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "87ddffd7-388b-38c0-9d24-2080f156ac4e",
                        "entry_id": "8934b523-1b5f-3c31-9d2e-7f0d78be2eeb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "тот, кто делает рисунки карандашом, пером"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a166cfcc-567b-4c74-9ca3-d0a02c654dda",
                                "sense_id": "87ddffd7-388b-38c0-9d24-2080f156ac4e",
                                "text": "Вернувшись на Остров в конце 1955 года, он чуть ли не на первой же вечеринке встретил Юрку и поразился, как отвратительно изменился его гимназический приятель, фантазёр, рисовальщик всяческих бригантин и фрегатов, застенчивый прыщавый дрочила."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "038bac09-bc52-4621-9533-915df2fe0c2f",
                                "sense_id": "87ddffd7-388b-38c0-9d24-2080f156ac4e",
                                "text": "А. Адам, рисовальщик топографического бюро 4-го армейского корпуса Е. Богарне, в своих рисунках и воспоминаниях отразил первые впечатления о месте предстоящего сражения вечером 5 сентября…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2222c963-d0b3-46f8-ba55-88cc4bd453c3",
                        "source_entry_id": "8934b523-1b5f-3c31-9d2e-7f0d78be2eeb",
                        "source_sense_id": "87ddffd7-388b-38c0-9d24-2080f156ac4e",
                        "target_lang_word": "draughtsman",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "draughtsman",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2eda32e2-13ac-3a0e-af08-58674f040ebe",
                                        "entry_id": "481daf45-0de1-3c0b-9408-326967e3c726",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person skilled at drawing engineering or architectural plans."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "547131bd-78ec-4f5b-b9b2-08d768740916",
                                                "sense_id": "2eda32e2-13ac-3a0e-af08-58674f040ebe",
                                                "text": "It was after the building and successful trials of the \"Lord Nelson\" engine on the Southern Railway that Sir Henry Fowler, then C.M.E. of the L.M.S.R., sent his chief draughtsman, Herbert Chambers, to Waterloo with the proposed weight diagram of a new 4-6-0 engine (to be known as a \"Royal Scot\" class), and to discuss the proposal with Mr. Clayton."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09db1aea-7d05-3373-994d-58c02fd6bb3e",
                                        "entry_id": "481daf45-0de1-3c0b-9408-326967e3c726",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A book illustrator."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dbd77010-672f-31bc-b734-70316fdf407c",
                                        "entry_id": "481daf45-0de1-3c0b-9408-326967e3c726",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who drinks drams; a tippler."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68c63984-9763-4244-8d48-985c9a56c150",
                                                "sense_id": "dbd77010-672f-31bc-b734-70316fdf407c",
                                                "text": "I have used my interest in several wards of the city , that the wholesome restorative above - mentioned may be given in tavern - kitchens to all the morning's draughtsmen within"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "draughtsman",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9dca98dd-9ae0-353d-a4fc-5566b14480fa",
                                        "entry_id": "68e15957-b1d7-3718-a3b2-40b44aec0500",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A piece in the game of draughts (checkers)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2ca9e52b-c975-4a09-b7dc-83c0a43d3587",
                        "source_entry_id": "8934b523-1b5f-3c31-9d2e-7f0d78be2eeb",
                        "source_sense_id": "87ddffd7-388b-38c0-9d24-2080f156ac4e",
